PANEL: Level complete. / CHAPTER 9 · THE LAST THAW · ARCHIVE REVELATION / What the archive kept / 2,800 story points · 4 documents surfaced from this run / MEMORY · MARA VEY / The Upper Vell dam / The Upper Vell dam held for ten summers. That is not nothing; it is the right thing, done late and once. When it went, the lake came down the stream toward the village by the route Anna had drawn on the handover map in red pen, and the village had already gone the other way, down the green route, the one they had practised. / LETTER · OCTOBER 2039 · TOMAS LIND / Letter from Tomas / Dear Mara, they tell me the chalet is still standing, kettles and all. Do not tell me which kettles; I would like to imagine all of them. I have been thinking about the stake line. Someone should drill a new one, higher up, where the ice still is. Not because it will change anything this year. Because the numbers are how you know where you are. Love, T. / NOTICE · AUGUST 2039 / Fjord chapel, notice board / Services suspended. Please keep out of what is left of the building. If you have come up here looking for someone, the lists are at the church hall in Carran, and everyone on them is accounted for. If you have come up here looking for something, take your time. There is a great deal of it. / MEMORY · MARA VEY / Heavy / You were enormous by the end. The thaw gathered everything above it on the way down, every field of old ice, and came down heavier than anyone had drawn. I am not proud of the comparison, but it is what Tomas's notebooks look like if you lay them in a row: every year a little more, every report a little later, until the weight is the whole story. / The Upper Vell / So: the last of it. You came off the Upper Vell with everything the mountain had left, and the dam built in eleven months for the lake of 2029 met the lake of 2039, and the lake won, as Anna had said in writing it would. I do not think of you as the villain of this. You are what was set in motion before I was born, by the valley a little and by the wider world a great deal. You were also, for nine chapters, a joy to watch. Both. I am keeping both. / From the archive · authored for this outcome / The agents' reflection is not shown (it did not pass the checks against your run); this one was written in advance. / The run, as recorded / CONTINUE TO THE EPILOGUE / REPLAY CHAPTER / VIEW THE RIVER / CHAPTERS
